    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally Spaced is a first-person puzzle adventure driven by mystery and exploration. Solve layered puzzles, explore atmospheric environments, and uncover the truth in a place designed to obscure it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escape the ship. Solve the puzzles. Question everything. Especially that one room. You\u2019ll know the one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is only the beginning.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally Spaced is a first-person puzzle adventure driven by mystery and exploration. Solve layered puzzles, explore atmospheric environments, and uncover the truth in a place designed to obscure it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Escape the ship. Solve the puzzles. Question everything. Especially that one room. You\u2019ll know the one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is only the beginning.</p>",
